<title>UK: UKs ECGD backs Thai mobile phone network expansion.</title>
<headline>UKs ECGD backs Thai mobile phone network expansion.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Export Credits Guarantee Department, Britain's official export credit agency, said on Thursday it was backing orders won by two companies to supply equipment for the expansion of Thailand's digital mobile telephone network.</p>
<p>The ECGD is underwriting loans worth a total 66 million stg to finance the orders won Nokia Telecommunications Ltd and Motorola Ltd.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7770 (fax +44 171 583 7239)</p>
</text>
